- The top like this.

00:05:41.517 --> 00:05:43.186
So you really wanna pinch it to seal it,

00:05:43.186 --> 00:05:45.313
and then even if it doesn't
seal all the way right now,

00:05:45.313 --> 00:05:46.814
we are gonna egg wash them.

00:05:46.814 --> 00:05:48.900
Literally you just
brush the tops with egg.

00:05:48.900 --> 00:05:51.068
It is exactly what it sounds like.

00:05:51.068 --> 00:05:52.361
And then you wanna vent the pie

00:05:52.361 --> 00:05:53.821
