00:05:53.821 --> 00:05:55.448
- Alright, I'm gonna do.

00:05:56.032 --> 00:05:57.325
Cool.

00:05:57.325 --> 00:05:58.117
- Here you go.

00:05:58.117 --> 00:05:59.869
- Okay.
- Gorgeous.

00:05:59.869 --> 00:06:01.454
- And then we'll put these in the oven,

00:06:01.454 --> 00:06:03.956
and let these bake, and
we'll give 'em a taste.

00:06:03.956 --> 00:06:06.501
- The starch goes through a
process called retrogradation

00:06:06.501 --> 00:06:09.086
where the molecules restructure
into a crystalline form.

00:06:09.086 --> 00:06:11.380
The flavor compounds are
trapped in said structure,

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:12.965
which makes every bite more flavorful.

00:06:12.965 --> 00:06:17.178
- Yeah, I definitely
tasted the extra molecules.

